{
  "format": "motion-piece.v1",
  "description": "Trapdoor: lines rise one after another from below the frame, each on its coloured card, land with a slight overshoot as a staircase, then all drop back down together (62 frames at 25 fps, room for 6 lines). Props lignes (the lines, top to bottom), accent (card colour), texte (text colour), police (font family), corps (type size in px), marge (% of the frame width left of the stack).",
  "use": "Two to five short lines that build up on the beat and stay readable together: a hook, a list of three, a date.",
  "avoid": "Body text, or a single word (the staircase needs several steps). Lines wider than the frame.",
  "invariants": [
    "Each line arrives from below the frame, 7 frames after the previous one; none fades in.",
    "Every arrival lands on the same curve, with a slight overshoot that never reaches its neighbour.",
    "The steps keep their offsets once landed: the stack holds still until it leaves.",
    "The whole stack leaves downward in one move, faster than it came.",
    "The first line is already rising at frame 0, so the piece can start on a cut."
  ],
  "origin": "Kinetic typography direction kept on a delivered film, September 2026; neutral version.",
  "composition": {
    "width": 1080,
    "height": 1920,
    "fps": 25,
    "duration": 62,
    "props": {
      "lignes": {
        "type": "list",
        "of": "text",
        "default": ["CHAQUE", "LIGNE", "MONTE", "À SON TOUR"]
      },
      "accent": {
        "type": "color",
        "default": "#FFD23F"
      },
      "texte": {
        "type": "color",
        "default": "#000000"
      },
      "police": {
        "type": "text",
        "default": "Helvetica Neue"
      },
      "corps": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": 30,
        "max": 300,
        "default": 118
      },
      "marge": {
        "type": "number",
        "unit": "%",
        "min": 0,
        "max": 60,
        "default": 10
      }
    },
    "formats": {
      "9x16": {
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 1920
      },
      "16x9": {
        "width": 1920,
        "height": 1080,
        "props": {
          "corps": 104,
          "marge": 12
        }
      },
      "1x1": {
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 1080,
        "props": {
          "corps": 104
        }
      }
    },
    "root": {
      "type": "fill",
      "style": {
        "justifyContent": "center",
        "paddingLeft": {
          "prop": "marge"
        }
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "box",
          "id": "pile",
          "style": {
            "flexDirection": "column",
            "alignItems": "flex-start",
            "gap": 14
          },
          "animate": {
            "translateY": {
              "interpolate": {
                "frames": [50, 56],
                "values": [0, 1400],
                "easing": "cubic-bezier(0.7, 0, 0.84, 0)"
              }
            }
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "repeat",
              "each": {
                "prop": "lignes"
              },
              "stagger": {
                "each": 7
              },
              "cycle": {
                "marginLeft": [0, 54, 0, 108]
              },
              "template": {
                "type": "box",
                "id": "carte",
                "style": {
                  "backgroundColor": {
                    "prop": "accent"
                  },
                  "paddingTop": 18,
                  "paddingBottom": 18,
                  "paddingLeft": 36,
                  "paddingRight": 36
                },
                "animate": {
                  "translateY": {
                    "interpolate": {
                      "frames": [-1, 9],
                      "values": [1400, 0],
                      "easing": "cubic-bezier(0.2, 1.12, 0.3, 1)"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": {
                      "item": true
                    },
                    "style": {
                      "fontFamily": { "prop": "police" },
                      "fontWeight": 700,
                      "lineHeight": 1.0,
                      "flexShrink": 0,
                      "fontSize": {
                        "prop": "corps"
                      },
                      "color": {
                        "prop": "texte"
                      }
                    },
                    "id": "ligne"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
